                  round(r_raw, 2), "&lt;/b&gt;, which is tempting to read as 'faster individuals ",
                  "reduce predation risk'. But movement speed has no effect on predation risk. ",
                  "Tick the box to account for body mass and watch the correlation collapse."))
    }
  })
}

